eWidth=1.5;fontColor=#00897b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="985" y="984.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1015" y="984.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c98" value="ExamPassed&lt;br&gt;(direct HTTP)" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#7030a0;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#7030a0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="555" y="438" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="555" y="463" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="-58" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c99" value="&lt;b style='font-size:21px'&gt;Service Discovery&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;(:8500)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style='text-align:left'&gt;• Registry: register, refresh, deregister, lookup by service name&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Keeps the topics each service subscribes to&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Polls every instance's &lt;b&gt;/health&lt;/b&gt; on an interval and alerts when an instance goes down or its load becomes critical&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;i&gt;Expire instances that stop refreshing&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=2;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=14;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1210" y="95" width="262" height="940" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c100" value="&lt;b&gt;Discord / Telegram&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;notifications to the developers" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1600" y="118" width="205" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c101" value="health / load alerts" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#3a5fcd;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#3a5fcd;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1472" y="155" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1600" y="155" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="0" y="-12" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c102" value="&lt;b style='font-size:17px'&gt;Shared Cache (Redis)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px'&gt;3 standalone nodes · internal only · no persistence&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=4;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#e07b00;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1530" y="240" width="280" height="280" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c103" value="redis-&lt;br&gt;cache-1" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=7;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e07b00;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1537" y="298" width="62" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c104" value="redis-&lt;br&gt;cache-2" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=7;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e07b00;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1605" y="298" width="62" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c105" value="redis-&lt;br&gt;cache-3" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=7;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e07b00;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1673" y="298" width="62" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c106" value="redis-&lt;br&gt;cache-4&lt;br&gt;(scale-up)" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=7;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e07b00;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;dashed=1;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1741" y="298" width="62" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c107" value="&lt;div style='text-align:left'&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Client-side sharding&lt;/b&gt;: consistent hashing over a ring of 160 virtual nodes per Redis node, in every service&lt;br&gt;• Cached GET answers of every domain service (&lt;i&gt;X-Cache&lt;/i&gt;) and the Gateway's verified tokens (&lt;i&gt;X-Auth-Cache&lt;/i&gt;)&lt;br&gt;• Keys prefixed with the service name, TTL + volatile-lru&lt;br&gt;• A failed node is a miss: the answer comes from the database&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1540" y="355" width="262" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c108" value="cache reads / writes (every domain service + Gateway)" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#e07b00;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#e07b00;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1530" y="480" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="455" y="174.0" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1492" y="480"/><mxPoint x="1492" y="1068"/><mxPoint x="455" y="1068"/></Array><mxPoint x="-260" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c109" value="" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#e07b00;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#e07b00;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="455" y="700" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="385" y="700" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c110" value="&lt;b style='font-size:16px'&gt;ETL Service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px'&gt;andrei045/kahoots-etl · every 300 s&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style='text-align:left;font-size:11px'&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Extract&lt;/b&gt;: every service database, read-only, from a standby / secondary (the primary is never loaded)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Transform&lt;/b&gt;: names, enum codes, date keys, durations, no emails or passwords&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Load&lt;/b&gt;: upsert into the star schema; each run in &lt;i&gt;etl_runs&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=4;fillColor=#e0f2f1;strokeColor=#00897b;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1530" y="620" width="280" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c111" value="&lt;b style='font-size:14px'&gt;Data Warehouse&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px'&gt;warehouse-db · kahoots_dw · :5440&lt;br&gt;star schema: dim_* and fact_* tables&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=12;fillColor=#e0f2f1;strokeColor=#00897b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1560" y="850" width="220" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c112" value="load" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#00897b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#00897b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1670" y="800" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1670" y="848" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="18" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c113" value="extract (ETL reads every DB)" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=2 3;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#00897b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#00897b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1015" y="158.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1528" y="710" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1015" y="1090"/><mxPoint x="1512" y="1090"/><mxPoint x="1512" y="710"/></Array><mxPoint x="-80" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c114" value="&lt;b style='font-size:18px'&gt;Message Broker&lt;/b&gt; (:8600 HTTP · :8601 gRPC)&lt;br&gt;Service queues for the Gateway's requests · gRPC calls between services · topic events&lt;br&gt;Load balancing by load · circuit breaker per instance, reroute and remove the tripped instance&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Saga coordinator&lt;/b&gt;: cure-zombie, steal-resources, clear-room, craft-item, base-upgrade (retries, compensations in reverse order)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fae5d3;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="515" y="1112" width="795" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c115" value="every request → service queue" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#3a5fcd;strokeWidth=2.5;fontColor=#3a5fcd;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="330" y="865" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="513" y="1170" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="330" y="1170"/></Array><mxPoint x="20" y="12" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c116" value="lookup instances · remove tripped instance" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#3a5fcd;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#3a5fcd;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1310" y="1165" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1405" y="1037" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1405" y="1165"/></Array><mxPoint x="60" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c117" value="" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=9;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="592" y="1278" width="165" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c118" value="" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=9;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="586" y="1284" width="165" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c119" value="&lt;b&gt;Broker DB&lt;/b&gt; ×3&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;queues · dead letters · sagas&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=9;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="1290" width="165" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c120" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=block;startFill=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;endSize=5;startSize=5;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="660" y="1230" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="660" y="1276" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c121" value="&lt;b&gt;Monitoring&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Prometheus · Alloy / Loki · Grafana" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f1f8e9;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1005" y="1290" width="305" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c122" value="metrics · logs" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#999999;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1157" y="1230" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1157" y="1288" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="0" y="-6" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c123" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="138" y="1400" width="1040" height="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c124" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="150" y="1408" width="100" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c125" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;strokeColor=#3a5fcd;strokeWidth=1.5;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="152" y="1444" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="208" y="1444" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c126" value="Request / call through the Message Broker (also the 2PC and saga steps)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="218" y="1434" width="520" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c127" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;strokeColor=#7030a0;strokeWidth=1.5;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="152" y="1466" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="208" y="1466" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c128" value="Direct service-to-service call" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="218" y="1456" width="520" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c129" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#4e9a3e;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="152" y="1488" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="208" y="1488" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c130" value="Service Discovery: registration and health polling" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="218" y="1478" width="520" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c131" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="152" y="1510" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="208" y="1510" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c132" value="WebSocket" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="218" y="1500" width="520" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c133" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;html=1;strokeColor=#999999;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="152" y="1532" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="208" y="1532" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c134" value="Monitoring" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="218" y="1522" width="520" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c135" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=block;startFill=1;html=1;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;endSize=5;startSize=5;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="152" y="1554" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="208" y="1554" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c136" value="Database access (to the primary)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="218" y="1544" width="520" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c137" value="" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;html=1;strokeColor=#e07b00;strokeWidth=1.5;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="152" y="1576" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="208" y="1576" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c138" value="Cache (Redis, sharded with consistent hashing)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="218" y="1566" width="520" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c139" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=2 3;html=1;strokeColor=#00897b;strokeWidth=1.5;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="152" y="1598" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="208" y="1598" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c140" value="ETL: extract from the databases, load into the warehouse" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="218" y="1588" width="520" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c141" value="&lt;div style='text-align:left'&gt;Stacked boxes = 3 replicas. Stacked cylinders = a 3-node database with automatic failover: a repmgr cluster (primary + 2 standbys, synchronous replication) for Player, Game, Resource, Base, Crafting, Gateway and Broker DB, a MongoDB replica set (rs0) for Zombie DB. Exam and World DB have a primary and 2 streaming read replicas.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Two-Phase Commit&lt;/b&gt; coordinators: Gateway (cure, steal), Game (clear room), Base (upgrade), Crafting (craft). &lt;b&gt;Sagas&lt;/b&gt; are coordinated by the Message Broker, with the Gateway, Game, Base and Crafting starting them in saga mode.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Calls marked &quot;via broker&quot; are gRPC calls to the Message Broker. Every caller has a circuit breaker (3 failures in task timeout × 3.5).&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="748" y="1434" width="420" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>